  mapping ROMs by FOLDER name (see treefrog-ui/cores.md + DEPLOY.md table). This
  config.xml is the STOCK rkgame <emucore> format, kept as documentation / fallback.
  Only cores whose .so is actually produced by the build will run on-device.
-->
